[[Awakened Head]]s [[spawn]] when an [[Awakened Gray Giant]] receives a [[critical hit]]. They yield [[experience]] and are counted by [[bounty|bounties]]; however, they do not appear to [[drop]] loot. Awakened Heads have no [[elite skill]], are mildly disruptive and can only deal damage through [[Frustration]], making them a minimal threat.

